# Environment

Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.

```env
# Required only for DB tooling (drizzle-kit push). The portfolio site and the
# health-only API server run without it.
DATABASE_URL=

# Optional local overrides (Replit artifact runtime provides these in prod).
PORT=5173
BASE_PATH=/
LOG_LEVEL=info
NODE_ENV=development

# Contact form (server-only Vercel env vars — never expose to the client, never commit real values).
RESEND_API_KEY= # Resend API key from the resend.com API Keys page (server sends via https://api.resend.com/emails).
FROM_EMAIL= # Sender identity for OTP + contact emails; uses Resend's free shared sender onboarding@resend.dev (no domain verification needed).
OTP_SIGNING_SECRET= # 64-char random hex for HMAC-signing OTP tokens; generate via `node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"`.
CONTACT_DESTINATION_EMAIL= # Inbox that receives verified contact messages.
# Comma-separated production portfolio origin(s) allowed by the API's CORS
# policy, e.g. ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-portfolio-domain.com
# (localhost dev origins are allowed automatically).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
```
